5:T415,# chainId

The ID of the specific chain the wallet is currently connected to.

## Property

`chainId?: string`

## Type

`string | undefined` - Chain ID in the appropriate format for the chain type

## Format

- **EVM chains**: Hex string (e.g., `"0x1"` for Ethereum mainnet, `"0x89"` for Polygon)
- **Other chains**: Decimal string or chain-specific format

## Usage

```tsx
  import { useAccount } from "__PACKAGE_NAME__";

  function ChainIdDisplay() {
  const { chainId, address } = useAccount();

  if (!address) {
    return <div>Not connected</div>;
  }

  return (
    <div>
      <div>Chain ID: {chainId || "N/A"}</div>
    </div>
  );
  }

```

## Notes

- Returns `undefined` if wallet is not connected
- Format depends on chain type
- Chain ID changes when user switches chains
- Common EVM chain IDs:
  - `0x1` - Ethereum Mainnet
  - `0x89` - Polygon
  - `0x38` - BNB Smart Chain
  - `0xa` - Optimism

## Related Properties

- `chainType` - Current chain type
- `address` - Wallet address
- `switchChain()` - Method to switch chains0:{"buildId":"HaSH0nfWkwbFYqcaqq3RQ","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"x:mx-auto x:flex x:max-w-(--nextra-content-width)","children":["$","$L2",null,{"value":[{"value":"Property","id":"property","depth":2},{"value":"Type","id":"type","depth":2},{"value":"Format","id":"format","depth":2},{"value":"Usage","id":"usage","depth":2},{"value":"Notes","id":"notes","depth":2},{"value":"Related Properties","id":"related-properties","depth":2}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{}],["$","$L4",null,{"metadata":{"title":"chainId","filePath":"content/hooks/useAccount/chainId.mdx","timestamp":1770719093000},"sourceCode":"$5","children":[["$","div",null,{"id":"nextra-skip-nav"}],["$","main",null,{"data-pagefind-body":true,"children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-bold x:mt-2 x:text-4xl","children":["chainId","$undefined"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":"The ID of the specific chain the wallet is currently connected to."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"property","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Property",["$","$L6",null,{"id":"property"}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":"chainId?: string"}]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"type","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Type",["$","$L6",null,{"id":"type"}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"children":"string | undefined"}]," - Chain ID in the appropriate format for the chain type"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"format","className":"x:t